        "title": "Kapma kalang bam mei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kapma kalang bammei,",
            "Ning summei guai luai the;",
            "Tingkau Salem ram khou bammei nunguai,",
            "Pap rihta ngam lou the (2),",
            "Thei meita ping lakkhe,",
            "He neilana bam kan the.",
            "",
            "2. Hei kandih hei jaona,",
            "Jingmei rui gumliam the;",
            "Rianamei nanun guai kalang bamme,",
            "Neila pui kan mun hei (2)",
            "Puang tuai lou puni the,",
            "He hei ram ta ai ninge.",
            "",
            "3. He nang jei pan khou rui,",
            "Kau namdai ta nkhuan;",
            "Duipang njianmei nun bam puiram khou,",
            "Khou 6$% jai kan lou o (2),",
            "Bumang thanmei nun khou,",
            "He ai bam kajao ni e.",
            "",
            "4. Salem namthan gai khou,",
            "Ai guang tang puni the;",
            "Kauh nthanmei nun le kanloumei nun,",
            "Guang bampang khou dinga (2),",
            "Neila pui lu suan ni,",
            "He Hallelujah tuna."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
